{"id":1010704,"name":"러스트·심문 IV","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"러스트·심문 IV","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1010704]}],"trial":{"trial_id":10704,"stage":"4단계","unlock_time":"2026-02-14 05:00:00","diary1":"당신은 전력을 다해 블랙링과 죽음의 그림자로부터 동료를 되찾았지만, 러스트 내면의 어둠은 그리 쉽게 걷히지 않았다.","diary2":"사람마다 저마다의 길이 있다. 블랙링을 쫓아 떠돌아다니는 해골은 다시 한번 여정에 나섰다. 하지만 이번에는 아무것도 없이 떠돌지 않을 것이다.\n　　이번에 그는 언젠가 돌아오겠다고 약속하며 한 장의 차용증을 남기고, 하나의 이름을 받아들이고, 하나의 인연을 품에 안고 떠났다….","evidence":[{"ID":260873,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260874,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":3,"dialogue_id":110704009,"next":[10]},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":3,"dialogue_id":110704013,"next":[14,17]},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704016,"next":[19]},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":3,"dialogue_id":110704021,"next":[22]},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110704023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialo